{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T16:37:55.248Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## Management access configuration":"## 管理访问配置","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/acme-renew **Type:** Command":"## certificate/acme-renew \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/add-acme **Type:** Command":"## certificate/add-acme \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/add-scep **Type:** Command":"## certificate/add-scep \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/builtin **Type:** Directory":"## certificate/builtin \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/card-reinstall **Type:** Command":"## certificate/card-reinstall \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/card-verify **Type:** Command":"## certificate/card-verify \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/create-certificate-request **Type:** Command":"## certificate/create-certificate-request \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/crl **Type:** Directory":"## certificate/crl \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/crl/download **Type:** Command":"## certificate/crl/download \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/crl/flush **Type:** Command":"## certificate/crl/flush \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## certificate/enable-ssl-certificate **Type:** Command":"## certificate/enable-ssl-certificate \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000#### Multiple switch groups":"#### 多个 switch 组","docs-7.25\u0000:::danger CRS1xx/2xx series switches can run multiple hardware offloaded bridges with(R)STP enabled, but it is not recommended since the device is not designed to run multiple(R)STP instances on a hardware level. To isolate multiple switch groups and have(R)STP enabled you should isolate port groups with port isolation profile configuration. :::":":::danger\nCRS1xx/2xx 系列交换机可以在启用 (R)STP 的情况下运行多个硬件卸载网桥，但不建议这样做，因为该设备并非设计用于在硬件层面运行多个 (R)STP 实例。要隔离多个交换组并启用 (R)STP，应通过端口隔离配置文件配置隔离端口组。\n:::","docs-7.25\u0000:::warning Multiple hardware offloaded bridge configuration is designed as a fast and simple port isolation solution, but it limits a part of the VLAN functionality supported by the CRS switch chip. For advanced configurations use one bridge within the CRS switch chip for all ports, configure VLANs, and isolate port groups with port isolation profile configuration. :::":":::warning\n多个硬件卸载网桥配置旨在提供快速、简单的端口隔离方案，但会限制 CRS 交换芯片支持的部分 VLAN 功能。对于高级配置，请在 CRS 交换芯片中为所有端口使用一个网桥，配置 VLAN，并通过端口隔离配置文件配置隔离端口组。\n:::","docs-7.25\u0000After a valid VLAN99 configuration has been set up, you can enable unknown/invalid VLAN filtering, which will not allow management access through different ports than specified in the VLAN table:":"完成有效的 VLAN99 配置后，可以启用 unknown/invalid VLAN filtering，这样将不允许通过 VLAN 表中指定端口以外的端口进行管理访问：","docs-7.25\u0000Allowing only tagged traffic to have management access to the device through a specific port is a much better practice. For example, to allow only **VLAN99** to access the device through **ether2**, you should first add an entry to the VLAN table, which will allow the selected port and the CPU port(**switch1-cpu**) to forward the selected VLAN ID, therefore allowing management access:":"仅允许带标签流量通过特定端口访问设备进行管理是更好的做法。例如，要仅允许 **VLAN99** 通过 **ether2** 访问设备，应先在 VLAN 表中添加条目，允许所选端口和 CPU 端口（**switch1-cpu**）转发所选 VLAN ID，从而允许管理访问：","docs-7.25\u0000If invalid VLAN filtering is not enabled, management access to the device using tagged or untagged(**VLAN 0**) traffic is already allowed from any port, though this is not a good practice; this can cause security issues and can cause the device's CPU to be overloaded in certain situations(most commonly with a broadcast type of traffic).":"如果未启用 invalid VLAN filtering，则已允许从任何端口使用带标签或未带标签（**VLAN 0**）流量访问设备进行管理，但这并不是良好做法；这可能导致安全问题，并在某些情况下导致设备 CPU 过载（最常见的是广播类流量）。","docs-7.25\u0000If you intend to use invalid VLAN filtering(which you should), then ports from which you are going to access the switch must be added to the VLAN table for untagged(**VLAN 0**) traffic, for example, in case you want to access the switch from **ether2**:":"如果打算使用 invalid VLAN filtering（建议这样做），则必须将用于访问交换机的端口添加到 VLAN 表中，以允许未带标签（**VLAN 0**）流量，例如，如果希望通过 **ether2** 访问交换机：","docs-7.25\u0000In all types of management access, it is assumed that ports must be switched together. Use the following commands to switch together the required ports:":"在所有类型的管理访问中，都假定端口必须交换在一起。使用以下命令将所需端口交换在一起：","docs-7.25\u0000In general, switches are only supposed to forward packets by using the built-in switch chip, but not allow access to the device itself for security reasons. It is possible to use the device's serial port for management access, but in most cases, such an access method is not desired and access using an IP address is more suitable. In such cases, you will need to configure management access.":"通常，交换机只应通过内置交换芯片转发数据包，而出于安全原因，不应允许访问设备本身。可以使用设备的串口进行管理访问，但在大多数情况下，不希望采用这种访问方式，使用 IP 地址访问更合适。在这种情况下，需要配置管理访问。","docs-7.25\u0000In this example VLAN99 will be used to access the device. A VLAN interface on the bridge must be created and an IP address must be assigned to it.":"在本示例中，VLAN99 将用于访问设备。必须在网桥上创建 VLAN 接口，并为其分配 IP 地址。","docs-7.25\u0000Packets that will be sent out from the CPU, for example, ping replies, will not have a VLAN tag, to solve this you need to specify which ports should always send out packets with a VLAN tag for a specific VLAN ID:":"从 CPU 发出的数据包（例如 ping 回复）不会带有 VLAN 标签。要解决此问题，需要指定哪些端口对于特定 VLAN ID 始终发送带 VLAN 标签的数据包：","docs-7.25\u0000Renew an existing ACME certificate.":"续订现有 ACME 证书。","docs-7.25\u0000The CRS1xx/2xx series switches allow you to use multiple bridges with hardware offloading; this allows you to easily isolate multiple switch groups. This can be done by simply creating multiple bridges and enabling hardware offloading.":"CRS1xx/2xx 系列交换机允许使用多个启用硬件卸载的网桥；这样可轻松隔离多个交换组。只需创建多个网桥并启用硬件卸载即可。","docs-7.25\u0000You should also assign an IP address to the bridge interface so the device is reachable using an IP address(the device is also reachable using a MAC address):":"还应为网桥接口分配 IP 地址，以便通过 IP 地址访问设备（也可以通过 MAC 地址访问设备）："}}
